# Serving a Quartz build.
#
# `caddy file-server` alone is not enough, and the way it fails is quiet: every
# internal link 404s while the front page works, because Quartz emits
# `stats.html` and links to `/stats`.
#
# The order below matters as much as the rule. Quartz emits *both* a
# `tags/gamereg.html` file and a `tags/gamereg/` directory, so matching the
# bare path first finds the directory, which has no index, and returns 404 for
# a page that is sitting right there. The .html candidate has to come first.
:8080 {
	root * /site
	try_files {path}.html {path}/index.html {path}
	file_server
	encode gzip
}
